The optional TRELLIS.2 shape generator includes Microsoft's TRELLIS.2 and
O-Voxel code at revision 75fbf0183001ed9876c8dbb35de6b68552ee08bd,
with changes for disk streaming, tiled decoding, chunked mesh extraction,
PyTorch attention and lazy imports for unused rendering operations.
It also includes FlexGEMM at revision
6dd94a859c26ee8246888502eada3dd8ad85532e, copyright 2025 Jianfeng Xiang,
and Eigen headers as a build dependency. Their license texts are installed
under /usr/share/doc/printable/trellis/.

Tiled decoding derives from Espalier at revision
b51fac8bb18f92f9f29f9aec771d0913b1b9c3c2, copyright 2026 over|yonder,
under the MIT License. Its license is included in the same directory.

No TRELLIS.2, DINOv3 or BiRefNet weights are packaged for this optional
generator. On first use the worker downloads pinned, hash-verified model
data to an operator-mapped persistent volume. DINOv3 weights are subject
to the publisher's separate model license and access requirements.
